message: 'To cite package "washinvestments" in publications use:'
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'washinvestments: Multilateral Development Bank Investment in Water and Sanitation'
version: 0.0.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.11203433
abstract: 'Dataset on multilateral development bank (MDB) investment in water supply
  and sanitation: 1,873 project records of the World Bank, the African Development
  Bank and the Asian Development Bank, approved between 1963 and 2020, compiled to
  assess territorial trends, technology choices, distribution of financial burdens,
  and reforms to institutional arrangements. Most records are for projects in Africa
  and Asia.'
